
# AXI4-to-APB Communication Subsystem IP for ADAS

## 1. Overview

This project implements an AXI4-to-APB communication subsystem IP
intended for ADAS-oriented SoC applications.

The project includes a Python-based Cocotb verification environment
used to verify AXI4 read/write transactions and the corresponding
APB peripheral accesses.

The verification focuses on register-level read/write operations
and checks whether the received data matches the expected data.

---

## 2. Software Required

The following software is required to run the verification:

- Python 3.x
- Cocotb
- A supported HDL simulator
- AXI4-to-APB subsystem RTL

### Python Packages

The Python verification environment uses:
cocotb
